{
  "name": "Law and accounting firm partners in a city, saved and added to a campaign",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Law and accounting firm partners in a city, saved and added to a campaign\n\n### How it works\nProfessional services firms buy through their partners. The form asks for a city and whether you want law firms, accounting firms or both. Argorant counts partners, owners and managing directors at legal services and accounting companies in that city (free). If the count is within max_people, they are saved as a list named after the city, which joins your campaign once it has filled; otherwise nothing is saved or spent and the form says so. Firms already in the campaign are not added twice.\n\nCosts: free until the list is added, then 1 credit per new person.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Set max_people in **Settings** and pick the campaign in **Add the list**.\n4. Activate and open the production URL of **City form**.\n\n### Customization\nAdd tax advisors or consultancies by changing the industries in **Industries for the choice**.",
        "height": 592,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "0e354207-8f61-4f79-b844-b62c84348555",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -260
      ]
    },
